+### Push Notifications
+
+Push notifications need a VAPID key pair, which you can generate and export like this:
+
+```sh
+bin/rails runner 'puts WebPush.generate_key.to_h'
+```
+
+Then run the dev server with them in the environment, turn on notifications in your
+notification settings, and see whatever lands in your tray land on your phone too:
+
+```sh
+VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=... VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=... bin/dev
+```
+
 ## SaaS gem
 
